---
import SiteLayout from "../../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../../../../data/pages.json";
import PageHeader from "../../../../components/PageHeader.astro";
import AccordionPanel from "../../../../components/AccordionPanel.astro";
const page = pages["/fr/equipe/sandra-paola-moreno-zamudio/"];
---
<SiteLayout page={page}>
<main class="site-main wpex-clr" id="main">
<PageHeader attributes={{"class": "page-header centered-page-header has-bg-image bg-fixed wpex-bg-fixed wpex-bg-cover wpex-bg-center wpex-bg-no-repeat wpex-relative wpex-mb-40 wpex-surface-2 wpex-py-30 wpex-border-t wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-surface-3 wpex-text-2 wpex-text-center wpex-supports-mods"}}>
<div class="page-header-inner container">
<div class="page-header-content">
<h1 class="page-header-title wpex-block wpex-m-0 wpex-text-5xl">
<span>SANDRA PAOLA MORENO ZAMUDIO</span>
</h1>
</div></div>
</PageHeader>
<div class="container wpex-clr" id="content-wrap">
<div class="content-area wpex-clr" id="primary">
<div class="site-content wpex-clr" id="content">
<div class="wpex-first-mt-0 wpex-clr" id="single-blocks">
<article class="single-content wpex-mt-20 entry wpex-clr" id="staff-single-content"><div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6 wpex-vc_col-has-fill vc_general vc_parallax vc_parallax-content-moving" data-vc-parallax="1.5"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><figure class="vcex-image vcex-module"><div class="vcex-image-inner wpex-relative wpex-inline-block"><img alt="" class="vcex-image-img wpex-align-middle" decoding="async" height="613" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" src="/assets/uploads/2024/03/fot-sandra_paola.png" srcset="/assets/uploads/2024/03/fot-sandra_paola.png 613w, /assets/uploads/2024/03/fot-sandra_paola-300x300.png 300w, /assets/uploads/2024/03/fot-sandra_paola-150x150.png 150w" width="613" /></div></figure><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapseAll"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-flat vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-o-shape-group vc_tta-controls-align-default vc_tta-o-no-fill vc_tta-o-all-clickable"><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815016-3d27d9bc-6e5b16353838888521704250904581"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815016-3d27d9bc-6e5b16353838888521704250904581"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Principaux domaines de pratique</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Conseil et contentieux et arbitrage civils et commerciaux, principalement dans les matières liées aux litiges immobiliers, à la responsabilité civile, à la procédure collective, à l'exécution de titres de crédit et aux litiges familiaux, ainsi qu'à l'exécution de divers contrats civils et commerciaux.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815244-9b2c1671-f9ab16353838888521704250904581"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815244-9b2c1671-f9ab16353838888521704250904581"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Formation</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Elle a étudié le droit à l’Escuela Libre de Derecho de Mexico (2021). Elle prépare actuellement sa soutenance de mémoire intitulé « Mesures conservatoires dans les procédures collectives : conditions de leur octroi aux codébiteurs solidaires de l’entreprise en procédure collective ».</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384006741-bee4bdd7-f4c21704250904581"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384006741-bee4bdd7-f4c21704250904581"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Parcours professionnel</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Avant de rejoindre CAMYA, Sandra a collaboré au sein des cabinets Cervantes Díaz Abogados, S.C. et Von Wobeser y Sierra, S.C.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815467-44e38ae2-228116353838888521704250904581"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815467-44e38ae2-228116353838888521704250904581"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Langues</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p>Espagnol et anglais.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel></div></div></div></div><div class="vcex-module vcex-divider vcex-divider-solid vcex-divider-center wpex-mx-auto wpex-block wpex-h-0 wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-main" style="border-color:#ca0043;"></div><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><style is:inline> style="height:150px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:150px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column has-custom-color wpex-child-inherit-color wpb_content_element" style="color:#c3004f;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:var(--wpex-tracking-widest);text-transform:uppercase;">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Collaboratrice</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="mailto:sandra.moreno@camya.mx">sandra.moreno@camya.mx</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Chez CAMYA, notre équipe réunit des avocats passionnés et spécialisés. Leur solide formation et la diversité de leurs expériences nous permettent de proposer des solutions juridiques innovantes. Nous nous engageons à être votre partenaire de confiance et à vous fournir des services de qualité qui dépassent les approches habituelles.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear"></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</SiteLayout>
